                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Another installment in the Mystery PI series done and dusted! Now that I've played my way through 3 of the 4 Mystery PI available on Steam, I am still very impressed with the quality of the games.\n\nThese are very no-frills Hidden Object Games. The story provides the setting and theme for the objects you will be hunting and then stays out of your way. After successfully searching from 3 to 8 scenes, you are challenged with a mini-game  to complete before you move on to more searching. And there is a lot of searching! I have yet to finish an entire game in less than 10 hours.\n\nOnce you complete the game, you can revisit each of the scenes and find all of the objects in the Unlimited Seek and Find mode. A lot of value for money spent, especially if you can get it on sale or bundled with other Popcap Games. \n\nRecommended.",
